With \code{smd = TRUE}, the tables contain an overall column and standardized
mean differences (via \code{\link[gtsummary:add_difference]{gtsummary::add_difference()}}) instead of p-values;
this requires the \pkg{smd} package. Continuous variables are summarised
on multiple lines (\code{"continuous2"}) and dichotomous variables are shown
