The weighted table is built from a \code{\link[survey:svydesign]{survey::svydesign()}} object using the
estimated weights, with the corresponding \verb{svy.*} tests from \pkg{gtsummary}.
With \code{smd = FALSE}, rows for factor levels that are empty in all groups are
dropped from the tables.
